<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Nov company investment rose yr/yr 2.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Belgian Nov company investment rose yr/yr 2.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium's National Statistics Office released the following data on corporate investment, calculated from VAT returns, for (mth) -</p>
<p>    COMPANY INVESTMENT     Nov	  Oct	 Nov 1995</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1985)  202.3	204.9     198.2</p>
<p>    Yr/yr pct change	 2.1	 15.6</p>
<p>    COMPANY INVESTMENT     Jan-Nov period    Jan-Oct period</p>
<p>    Yr/yr pct change	 5.4		   5.9</p>
<p>NOTE - non-industrial investments rose 2.4 percent in the first 11 months, industrial investments rose by 10.8 percent.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
